# Journey to Windurst, part 2 (San d'Oria 2-3, mission.sandoria.journey_to_windurst2). A level 30 Warrior of San d'Oria
# in Windurst Woods with the mission current (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's first mission out).
# Mourices at status 0 and 7: the zone's DefaultActions event 441 (neither arm answers). Status 8: 463 (progress).
# Status 11: 441 again. Status 9: 467 (progress), whose finish completes the mission, begins Journey Abroad (San d'Oria
# 5), moves to status 11 and gives the Kindred Report (no crest is held, so none is taken). The login in Windurst Woods
# also plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in 839, whose finish sets SoA status 4.
lists BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32001 HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/242 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/246 WindurstWoods/Mourices/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/467
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-50.6,-0.5,-27.6 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria JourneyToWindurst2 current
login
trigger Mourices
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 7
trigger Mourices
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 8
trigger Mourices
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 11
trigger Mourices
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 9
trigger Mourices
finish-if-event
finish
